@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我不明白……<br>诺亚她根本没做错什么吧……！为什么！？|#0101Adv35_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对艾玛悲声发问，<br>蕾雅露出了一丝笑容。|#0101Adv35_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

