[PrintTextModified Text:接下来就要<br>把莲见蕾雅关进这里面咯。|#0101Adv35_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哈，天使里面？是想挖苦她，要她变得和天使一样圣洁吗。|#0101Adv35_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:感觉有些恶趣味。|#0101Adv35_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [hideStill]
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛等人望着天使像，<br>难以想像接下来会实施怎样的刑罚。|#0101Adv35_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只不过，蕾雅的脸色比之前<br>变得更加惨白了，甚至浑身在发抖。|#0101Adv35_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（蕾雅……？）|#0101Adv35_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，其他人请不要动哦。<br>如果有人妨碍或者介入，看守将对其同样定罪。|#0101Adv35_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

