[PrintTextModified Text:啊、啊啊、啊——|#0101Adv35_Leia018| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对，我承认！<br>我想变得引人注目！|#0101Adv35_Leia019| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一定要是最显眼的那个！<br>所以，我没法原谅她！|#0101Adv35_Leia020| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:城崎诺亚把舞台的主角抢走了，<br>所以我就想，一定要杀了她！|#0101Adv35_Leia021| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她真是太碍事了！|#0101Adv35_Leia022| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（啊，原来是这样——蕾雅她并不是<br>　不愿意被针刺惨死……）|#0101Adv35_Ema019|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:410_2 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:要是被关进这里面，大家不就<br>看不到我了吗！！|#0101Adv35_Leia023| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而是不愿意让大家看不见她。|#0101Adv35_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

